<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-PORTUGAL BEAT ALBANIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGAL BEAT ALBANIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal beat Albania 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup European group nine qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Luis Figo (11th minute), Helder Cristovao (77th),</p>
<p>Rui Costa (89th).</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
</text>
